# Data fetching (target state)

## Server state

- Prefer TanStack Query (`useQuery` / `useMutation`) for all remote data
- Do **not** add `useEffect` + direct axios/fetch for domain loads in components
- Auth user remains in `AuthContext` for now; do not invent a second parallel user cache without a migration plan
- Do not make network failures during `/users/me` silently treat stale localStorage as fully trusted without a clear product decision

## Keys & invalidation

- Use stable, domain-prefixed query keys (`['eventComplete', id]`, ...); prefer per-domain key factories for new modules
- After scoring / structure / **lane assign / check-in** mutations, invalidate the same downstream sets existing scoring flows use (event complete, squad games, squad participants, realtime status, ...) - extract shared invalidators when duplicating
- Gate fetches with `enabled` tied to tab/capability so inactive tabs do not hammer the API

## Mutations

- Surface errors with `getErrorMessage`
- Optimistic updates must type the cached shape (no `any` callbacks) and roll back on failure

## Capability UX

Combine `DirectorsAPI.getEventDirectorAccess` / `useTournamentManagementAccess` / `mapDirectorAccessToUiFlags` - do not invent "any TD can edit" shortcuts.
